# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Runtime debug output written by the vision scripts (camera captures,
# HSV masks, warped/cleaned board views, ArUco overlays, etc.) -- not
# source, shouldn't be committed. Curated images for docs go in
# docs/images/ instead, which is explicitly kept.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
!docs/images/**
